; The turtle at the edges: WRAP, WINDOW and FENCE.

PRINT TURTLEMODE
SETPC 10
; In WRAP mode, a long line comes back on the other side.
RT 20 FD 1500
WINDOW
PRINT TURTLEMODE
FD 300
; WRAP brings the turtle back inside.
WRAP
SHOW POS
PRINT XCOR PRINT YCOR PRINT HEADING
FENCE
PRINT TURTLEMODE
SETPC 14
HOME
FD 200 RT 90 FD 200
PRINT TOWARDS [0 0]
SETHEADING TOWARDS [0 0]
FD 100
WRAP
HT PRINT SHOWNP ST PRINT SHOWN?
